{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Permanent-chat deletion — agreed\n\nAccepted in D-049.\nStop and restore the active coding run, then delete its chat.\nEarlier-run code remains.\n\n[[Run Lifecycle Design]]\n[[Remaining Harness Decisions]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -450,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 310,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "delete",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 1 · User requests Delete\n\nMake the active-run consequence clear: this includes undoing its tracked edits.\nDeleting an idle chat keeps existing code.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "block",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 2 · Mark deleting\n\nCapture any active run.\nBlock new prompts, tools, approvals, moves and retrieval.\nNo late completion can revive the chat.",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "active",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 3 · Active tracked repo edits?\n\nCheck actual run state when Delete is accepted.\nOnly the active run is eligible for this Stop-style restoration.",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "stop",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 4 · Cancel and settle\n\nCancel generation, retries and approvals.\nSettle writers safely.\nKeep other repo editing runs queued.\nNo model-written farewell needed.",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "restore",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 5 · Restore that run\n\nReuse guarded Stop rollback.\nPreserve earlier/user changes.\nVerify actual filesystem state.\nKeep recovery data until settled.",
      "x": 2000,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "cleanup",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 6 · Delete chat data\n\nAfter safe cancellation/restoration, remove transcript, local provider state and chat-only derived data.\nApply the agreed source/memory boundary.",
      "x": 2500,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "done",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 7 · Chat removed\n\nDiscard late callbacks and memory writes.\nDo not recreate chat records.\nRelease repository editing once recovery is settled.",
      "x": 3000,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "no_restore",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## No active edits to restore\n\nCancel/settle an active text/read-only run, if any.\nAn idle chat has no run to cancel.\nKeep existing repository changes and proceed to chat cleanup.",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 550,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "attention",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Deletion paused\n\nRestoration incomplete or effects uncertain.\nRetain recovery state and show remaining changes/conflicts.\nResolve recovery or explicitly keep the remaining state before finishing deletion.",
      "x": 2000,
      "y": 550,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "earlier",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Preserve earlier work\n\nEarlier finished/failed-run edits remain.\nDo not remove the project or repo folder.\nThe chat’s permanent project binding does not prohibit deleting the chat.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 550,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "approval",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Cancel pending permissions\n\nLate approval clicks cannot run the deleted chat’s action.\nDo not start another model request to finish or summarize a deleting chat.",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 550,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "memory",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## D-029 memory boundary\n\nDelete this source and its references.\nKeep other chats and facts supported elsewhere.\nInvalidate unsupported managed memory/caches.\n[[Memory & Context Policy]]",
      "x": 2500,
      "y": 550,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "scope",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Remaining boundaries\n\nTracked repository-file rollback only.\nCommands/external effects need separate recovery guarantees.\nWhole-project/section deletion is a later choice.",
      "x": 3000,
      "y": 550,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
